{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18020","headline":"新竹 · 韩愈","name":"新竹","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"笋添南堦竹，日日成清閟。\n缥节已储霜，黄苞犹揜翠。\n出栏抽五六，当户罗三四。\n高标陵秋严，贞色夺春媚。\n稀生巧补林，并出疑争地。\n纵横乍依行，烂熳忽无次。\n风枝未飘吹，露粉先涵泪。\n何人可携翫，清景空瞪视。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18020.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18020","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}